The *.txt files here are the standard licence and exception texts of the SPDX License List,
verbatim from https://github.com/spdx/license-list-data (tag v3.29.0, directory `text/`).
They are used by scripts/gen-licenses.py for a crate that ships no licence file of its own; the
copyright line of a template (MIT, BSD) is the template's placeholder, not a claim about the crate.
An SPDX id that appears in a crate's licence expression and has no file here fails
`scripts/gen-licenses.py --check`: add the text from the list, never write one by hand.
